Description: online multiplayer tactical warfare game - data files
 netPanzer is an isometric view real-time tactical game designed for
 play across the Internet and over LAN systems.
 .
 This package contains the maps, sounds, unit sprites, artwork and scripts
 the game loads at runtime. It is architecture independent, which is why it
 is split from the engine rather than shipped with it -- the data is by far
 the larger half.
